<title>FRANCE: Aero International wins $300 mln Northwest order.</title>
<headline>Aero International wins $300 mln Northwest order.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aero International, a venture of France's Aerospatiale, Italy's Alenia and British Aerospace, said on Tuesday that Northwest Airlines had placed a firm order for 12 Avro RJ jets with an option to acquire up to 24 more.</p>
</text>
